msgid "Welcome to Oasis Workflow"
msgstr "Bienvenido a Oasis Workflow"

#: oasis-workflow-pro.php:396
msgid "To get started with Oasis Workflow follow the steps listed below."
msgstr "Para comenzar con Oasis WorkFlow sigue los siguientes pasos."

#: oasis-workflow-pro.php:397
#, php-format
msgid ""
"1. Activate the plugin by providing a valid license key on Workflows %s "
"Settings, License tab."
msgstr ""
"1. Escribe una clave de licencia válida en la pestaña de Licencia en la "
"configuración de WorkFlow %s."

#: oasis-workflow-pro.php:398
msgid ""
"2. Create a new workflow OR modify/use the \"Sample Workflow\" which comes "
"with the plugin."
msgstr ""
"2. Crear un nuevo WorkFlow o modifica/usa el \"Workflow de ejemplo\" que "
"viene con el plugin."

#: oasis-workflow-pro.php:399
#, php-format
msgid ""
"3. Activate the workflow process by going to Workflows %s Settings, Workflow "
"tab."
msgstr "3. Activa el proceso WorkFlow en la pestaña WorkFlow  %s."

#: oasis-workflow-pro.php:543
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In order to use the \"Pro\" version, you need to deactivate and delete the "
"free/lite version of Oasis Workflow plugin on the %splugins page%s"
msgstr ""
"Para utilizar la versión \"Pro\", es necesario desactivar y eliminar la "
"versión libre / Lite de Oasis de flujo de trabajo plugin en la %spágina "
"plugins%s"

